{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794253492015,"sessionID":"ses_e3e3427dcffeAM5VdMFblkhGPV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"toolu_019BzDfqvWZTaHviNW6QkU5c","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='README.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file.\",\n\"Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved, hashed versions and is installed with `pip install --require-hashes -r backend/requirements.lock`.\")\ns+=\"\\n## Checks\\n\\n- Backend tests: `python -m unittest backend/test_app.py`\\n- Frontend typecheck: `cd frontend && npm run typecheck` (also run by `npm run build`)\\n\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngit diff README.md Dockerfile | head -30","workdir":"/workspace"},"output":"diff --git a/Dockerfile b/Dockerfile\nindex 214952b..c243fc1 100644\n--- a/Dockerfile\n+++ b/Dockerfile\n@@ -14,7 +14,7 @@ ENV PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 \\\n WORKDIR /app\n COPY backend/requirements.txt backend/requirements.lock* backend/\n RUN if [ -f backend/requirements.lock ]; then \\\n-      pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt -c backend/requirements.lock; \\\n+      pip install --no-cache-dir --require-hashes -r backend/requirements.lock; \\\n     else \\\n       pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt; \\\n     fi\ndiff --git a/README.md b/README.md\nindex 24967b9..51a3539 100644\n--- a/README.md\n+++ b/README.md\n@@ -12,4 +12,9 @@\n - `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n - `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n \n-Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n+Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved, hashed versions and is installed with `pip install --require-hashes -r backend/requirements.lock`. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n+\n+## Checks\n+\n+- Backend tests: `python -m unittest backend/test_app.py`\n+- Frontend typecheck: `cd frontend && npm run typecheck` (also run by `npm run build`)\n","metadata":{"output":"diff --git a/Dockerfile b/Dockerfile\nindex 214952b..c243fc1 100644\n--- a/Dockerfile\n+++ b/Dockerfile\n@@ -14,7 +14,7 @@ ENV PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 \\\n WORKDIR /app\n COPY backend/requirements.txt backend/requirements.lock* backend/\n RUN if [ -f backend/requirements.lock ]; then \\\n-      pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt -c backend/requirements.lock; \\\n+      pip install --no-cache-dir --require-hashes -r backend/requirements.lock; \\\n     else \\\n       pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt; \\\n     fi\ndiff --git a/README.md b/README.md\nindex 24967b9..51a3539 100644\n--- a/README.md\n+++ b/README.md\n@@ -12,4 +12,9 @@\n - `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n - `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n \n-Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n+Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved, hashed versions and is installed with `pip install --require-hashes -r backend/requirements.lock`. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n+\n+## Checks\n+\n+- Backend tests: `python -m unittest backend/test_app.py`\n+- Frontend typecheck: `cd frontend && npm run typecheck` (also run by `npm run build`)\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='README.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file.\",\n\"Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved, hashed versions and is installed with `pip install --require-hashes -r backend/requirements.lock`.\")\ns+=\"\\n## Checks\\n\\n- Backend tests: `python -m unittest backend/test_app.py`\\n- Frontend typecheck: `cd frontend && npm run typecheck` (also run by `npm run build`)\\n\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngit diff README.md Dockerfile | head -30","time":{"start":1794253491929,"end":1794253491977}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c1d78ed40012GqmphwakhcJck","sessionID":"ses_e3e3427dcffeAM5VdMFblkhGPV","messageID":"msg_1c1d77c87001vz25SHSyDjLxW4"}}
